      "title": "Larkspur Supply Co. opens the region's first gear library",
      "site": "Larkspur Supply Co.",
      "description": "Members can borrow tents, stoves, and snowshoes for free, starting 1 November 2026.",
      "heading": "Larkspur Supply Co. opens the region's first gear library",
      "subtitle": "Members can borrow tents, stoves, and snowshoes for free, starting 1 November 2026.",
      "byline": "For immediate release · Port Wren · <time datetime=\"2026-10-14\">14 October 2026</time>"
    },
    "slots": {
      "body": [
        {
          "use": "content/prose",
          "key": "intro",
          "data": {
            "html": "<p>Port Wren — Larkspur Supply Co. will open a gear library on <time datetime=\"2026-11-01\">1 November 2026</time>. Members can borrow up to three items for a week at no cost. The library starts with 240 items donated by members and repaired in the co-op's workshop.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "use": "content/quote",
          "key": "raman",
          "data": {
            "quote": "Most gear spends its life in a closet. A library puts it back on the trail.",
            "author": "Priya Raman, general manager"
          }
        },
        {
          "use": "content/prose",
          "key": "hours",
          "data": {
            "html": "<p>The library will be open during store hours at 214 Alder Street.</p><p><strong>About Larkspur Supply Co.:</strong> Founded in 1987, the cooperative is owned by 9,400 members and sells, rents, and repairs outdoor equipment.</p><p><strong>Media contact:</strong> Sam Whitlock, <a href=\"mailto:press@larkspur.coop\">press@larkspur.coop</a>, (360) 555-0177.</p>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
